    "title": "I like you! Date with me!",
    "description": "Don't have time for lengthy dating games?\r\nChoose Your Fate! Capture the heart of your ideal match!\r\n\r\nQuickly immerse yourself in the romance with this super-fast mini-game!\r\n\r\nFrom kindergarten teachers to childhood friends, meat lovers, fairies, new tutors, secretaries, maids, and more\u2014\r\nthe choices are endless!\r\n\r\nFind your perfect match in our unique '2-options' game.\r\nConsider your partner's feelings and respond wisely!\r\n\r\nHow to play? \r\n1) Read the scenario displayed at the top of the screen. \r\n2) Select one of the two options below. \r\n3) A successful choice increases affection and progresses you to the next question. \r\n4) Capture their heart by succeeding in all four questions! \r\n\r\nDon't worry about making mistakes; \r\nyou can easily restart with no pressure and play as many times as you want!\r\n\r\nDownload it now!\r\nLet's aim for a happy ending!\r\n\r\nEU / California users can opt-out under GDPR / CCPA.\r\nPlease respond from the pop-up displayed when starting in the app or within the settings in the app.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Don&#39;t have time for lengthy dating games?<br>Choose Your Fate! Capture the heart of your ideal match!<br><br>Quickly immerse yourself in the romance with this super-fast mini-game!<br><br>From kindergarten teachers to childhood friends, meat lovers, fairies, new tutors, secretaries, maids, and more\u2014<br>the choices are endless!<br><br>Find your perfect match in our unique &#39;2-options&#39; game.<br>Consider your partner&#39;s feelings and respond wisely!<br><br>How to play? <br>1) Read the scenario displayed at the top of the screen. <br>2) Select one of the two options below. <br>3) A successful choice increases affection and progresses you to the next question. <br>4) Capture their heart by succeeding in all four questions! <br><br>Don&#39;t worry about making mistakes; <br>you can easily restart with no pressure and play as many times as you want!<br><br>Download it now!<br>Let&#39;s aim for a happy ending!<br><br>EU / California users can opt-out under GDPR / CCPA.<br>Please respond from the pop-up displayed when starting in the app or within the settings in the app.",
